# One component of M members over M/10 result types, every call of it a
# frame of its caller's type: frames once cloned a member per result type,
# M times R, where a stack per result type is M plus R. At twice the size
# both M and R double, so M times R would be four times the work, and no
# count of the compiler's work may grow faster than the program.
step_limit=120
. "$IDRIS_MLIR_ROOT/harness/testutils.sh"
. "$root/harness/lib/scale.sh"
scale_relation component
